    "homeType": "TOWNHOUSE",
    "description": "Nestled in the highly desirable, gated Lake Merced Hills community, this spacious 3-bedroom, 2.5-bath townhome offers the perfect blend of tranquil living and modern convenience. Enter into a grand foyer with a large storage/closet space.  Ascend to the main living area, a light-filled open-concept living and dining area with soaring ceilings, a cozy fireplace, and sliding glass doors that open to a private balcony ideal for relaxing or entertaining with Lake Merced views. The kitchen is updated with stainless steel appliances, beautiful cabinetry with new hardware, storage for all of your culinary + entertaining tools and a breakfast nook perfect for casual dining. Upstairs, the expansive primary suite includes ample closet space and a spa-like ensuite with a walk-in shower. Two additional bedrooms and an updated full bath provide flexibility for guests, family, or home office needs. Additional highlights include a laundry room on the lower level, an office or guest room at the backside of the attached garage and generous storage throughout. Residents enjoy access to resort-style amenities, including a swimming pool, spa, tennis courts, + 24-hour security.  With close proximity to Lake Merced, multiple golf courses and easy freeway access, this home has it all!"
  },
